    "hero": {
      "type": "landing-hero",
      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "Limited-Time: Save 20% on First Order",
        "heading": "Your Gut Travels With You. Make Sure It's Ready.",
        "text": "<p>See why over 1 million Travelers never leave home without Tiiga</p>",
        "image_1": "shopify://shop_images/Tiiga.Marketing-HP147.JPG",
        "image_2": "",
        "primary_button_label": "Save 20% + Free Shipping",
        "primary_button_link": "shopify://products/organic-baobab-coconut-water-prebiotic-electrolyte-supplement-16-pack-bag",
        "secondary_button_label": "Shop All Products",
        "secondary_button_link": "shopify://collections/all",
        "rating": "4.7",
        "review_count": "850+ reviews",
        "shipping_note": "Free shipping $40+",
        "disclaimer": "<p>Cancel anytime · 30-day money-back guarantee · These statements have not been evaluated by the FDA.</p>",
        "background_color": "#1d5a6b",
        "text_color": "#ffffff",
        "padding-block-start": 64,
        "padding-block-end": 64,
        "layout": "split"
      }
    },
    "story_rows": {
      "type": "story-rows",
      "blocks": {
        "row_1": {
          "type": "_story-row",
          "settings": {
            "number": "01",
            "eyebrow": "DIGESTION",
            "title": "Travel Kills Your Gut Routine. Tiiga Revives It.",
            "text": "<p>New time zones, restaurant meals, no fiber in airport food. Your gut never stood a chance. Tiiga's 5g of raw prebiotic fiber feeds the good bacteria that keep you regular. No laxatives, no guesswork.</p>",
            "media_style": "image",
            "media_position": "right",
            "image_1": "shopify://shop_images/airport.png",
            "image_2": "",
            "background_color": "#ffffff"
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "row_2": {
          "type": "_story-row",
          "settings": {
            "number": "02",
            "eyebrow": "EASE",
            "title": "No Bulky Bottles. Just a Stick That Fits in Your Carry-On.",
            "text": "<p>Forget the powder tub you'll never mix right in a hotel room, or the six bottles eating half your toiletry bag. Tiiga comes in pre-portioned daily sticks. TSA-friendly, no measuring, no mess.</p>",
            "media_style": "image",
            "media_position": "left",
            "image_1": "shopify://shop_images/carry-on.png",
            "image_2": "",
            "background_color": "#ffffff"
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "row_3": {
          "type": "_story-row",
          "settings": {
            "number": "03",
            "eyebrow": "ENERGY",
            "title": "Stop Landing Exhausted. Start Landing Ready.",
            "text": "<p>Jet lag wrecks more than your sleep. It tanks your focus, your mood, and your first two days away. Tiiga packs B-vitamins, adaptogens, and real coconut water electrolytes to support steady, jitter-free energy, so you land ready to go.</p>",
            "media_style": "image",
            "media_position": "right",
            "image_1": "shopify://shop_images/Copy_of_Tiiga.Marketing-HP054_56f2916a-a47c-4ac8-8275-d90aba3cb7ea.jpg",
            "image_2": "",
            "background_color": "#ffffff"
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "row_4": {
          "type": "_story-row",
          "settings": {
            "number": "04",
            "eyebrow": "IMMUNITY",
            "title": "Airplanes Are Petri Dishes. Your Gut Is Your Last Line of Defense.",
            "text": "<p>Recycled cabin air, crowded terminals, zero sleep. Travel is an open invitation your immune system didn't ask for. About 70% of it lives in your gut. Tiiga's 5g of prebiotic fiber comes from raw baobab, which also brings vitamin C to support immune function, so one stick feeds the gut bacteria your immunity depends on.</p>",
            "media_style": "image",
            "media_position": "left",
            "image_1": "shopify://shop_images/graphic.png",
            "image_2": "",
            "background_color": "#ffffff"
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "row_5": {
          "type": "_story-row",
          "settings": {
            "number": "05",
            "eyebrow": "DEHYDRATION",
            "title": "Cabin Air Drains You Faster Than Any Workout.",
            "text": "<p>Airplane humidity sits below 8%, drier than the Sahara. Most travelers land dehydrated without knowing it. Tiiga's real coconut water electrolytes help your body absorb water at the cellular level instead of passing it through.</p>",
            "media_style": "image",
            "media_position": "right",
            "image_1": "shopify://shop_images/c388fdec-e706-4743-939c-c03de6fa31ff.png",
            "image_2": "",
            "background_color": "#ffffff"
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "row_6": {
          "type": "_story-row",
          "settings": {
            "number": "06",
            "eyebrow": "SKIP THE FOMO",
            "title": "Eat Like a Local, Skip the Regret.",
            "text": "<p>Nobody wants to spend their first day abroad bloated and backed up. Air travel dehydrates you and slows digestion, making constipation one of the most common travel complaints. Tiiga's 5g of prebiotic fiber keeps things moving, even when your routine doesn't.</p>",
            "media_style": "image",
            "media_position": "left",
            "image_1": "shopify://shop_images/87b04e86-e9cd-426a-adf4-c646a2efe400.png",
            "image_2": "",
            "background_color": "#ffffff"
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "row_7": {
          "type": "_story-row",
          "settings": {
            "number": "07",
            "eyebrow": "REVIEWS",
            "title": "The Top Choice for Electrolytes and Gut Health",
            "text": "<p>Hundreds of five-star reviews, and they keep landing on the same three reasons. Tiiga is what people reach for when they want electrolytes and gut health in one stick instead of a shelf full of separate products.</p>",
            "media_style": "checklist",
            "media_position": "right",
            "checklist": "Convenience: pre-portioned sticks, no measuring and no clean-up\nTaste: real fruit flavors with no added sugar\nWhole-body support: prebiotic fiber for your gut, electrolytes for real hydration",
            "background_color": "#1d5a6b",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          },
          "blocks": {}
        }
      },
